###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Accuracy is stated only qualitatively: 'more than 90% accuracy on hold-out frames' and test RMSEs 'corresponding to 20% of standard deviations' (details in Figure S4 of the Supporting Information, not part of the PDF read). No AccuracyMetric is encoded.
# - Descriptor type, cutoff, network sizes, loss prefactors and training steps are not given in the main text.
# - The paper is mainly experimental (emulsion crystallization, sensitivity tests); the MD results (interfacial species distributions under sliding, oscillation analysis) have no place in the protocol.
# - The manifest classes this paper as 'Method/model'; it is an application of an existing method.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
